Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:18.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Kartal waltzes into the Wuhan final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡塔尔闯进了武汉决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:22.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Her big moment in a 1000 arrives.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的一千赛高光时刻来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}An outstanding victory.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场了不起的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.18,TL,,0,0,0,,排名第{\fs78}170{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:31.14,TL,,0,0,0,,这个数字说的不是她的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:33.33,TL,,0,0,0,,是她停下来的那半年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:36.17,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:37.91,TL,,0,0,0,,卡塔尔连赢两个抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:39.73,TL,,0,0,0,,淘汰了奥斯塔彭科
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:42.52,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}个月前 她因为背伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:45.64,TL,,0,0,0,,她在布莱顿长大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:48.20,TL,,0,0,0,,从小到大 她最常碰到的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:49.88,TL,,0,0,0,,叫拉杜卡努
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.49,0:00:54.12,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2011{\fs68}年 英国{\fs78}10{\fs68}岁以下组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:55.07,TL,,0,0,0,,两个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:57.37,TL,,0,0,0,,打出了一个停不下来的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.37,0:00:59.46,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 一个拿了美网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.46,0:01:01.60,TL,,0,0,0,,一个还在一场一场地打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:07.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Emma and I, we grew up playing each other,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我和艾玛从小就是对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:10.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}kind of from mini tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从迷你网球就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:14.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I've got an older brother, he's five years older than me,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我有个哥哥 比我大五岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:16.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and he used to play just for fun.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他打球只是为了好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:19.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And my parents used to take me up to the club,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N爸妈带我去俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:22.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I used to just sit on the grass and watch him play.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我就坐在草地上看他打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:25.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's how it all began.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一切就是这么开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.89,0:01:27.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I also just want to still love tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我也想一直热爱网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.09,0:01:32.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't want that feeling of enjoying coming on the court to ever disappear{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不想让上场的快乐消失
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:34.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and almost have to feel like a chore.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不想让它变成一份苦差
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.89,0:01:37.38,TL,,0,0,0,,她个子不高 靠的是脚步和耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:39.70,TL,,0,0,0,,把一个又一个球救回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:40.57,TL,,0,0,0,,她的排名
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.57,0:01:43.06,TL,,0,0,0,,也是这么一场一场打上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:45.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.97,0:01:47.56,TL,,0,0,0,,排名{\fs78}295{\fs68}的她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:49.53,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛打进第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:52.22,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}27{\fs68}年来 英国女子资格赛球员里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:54.13,TL,,0,0,0,,她是第一个做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:58.81,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 她拿到生涯第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:01.01,TL,,0,0,0,,最高升到世界第{\fs78}44{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:02.99,TL,,0,0,0,,今年{\fs78}3{\fs68}月 背已经开始疼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.99,0:02:05.07,TL,,0,0,0,,她还是逆转了凯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.59,0:02:07.88,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下凯斯那晚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:09.70,TL,,0,0,0,,她说比赛里背时不时在疼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:10.85,TL,,0,0,0,,可正是这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.85,0:02:12.98,TL,,0,0,0,,打出了她身上的斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:17.47,TL,,0,0,0,,两天后的第四轮 她撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:20.07,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后时退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.07,0:02:21.84,TL,,0,0,0,,背部应力性骨折
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}个大满贯 她错过了{\fs78}3{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:26.05,TL,,0,0,0,,包括家门口的温网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.47,0:02:30.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Tennis is all I've known, right?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N网球是我唯一熟悉的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:32.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The past 18 years I've done it every day,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N过去{\fs78}18{\fs68}年我每天都在打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.67,0:02:36.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and just not being able to do that,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N突然什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.09,0:02:41.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and just feeling so like I couldn't do the basic of things.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N连最基本的事都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.93,0:02:46.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I couldn't brush my teeth without almost standing back up and just being in agony.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刷牙都得马上直起腰 疼得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:48.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So it was definitely a tough injury,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这真的是一次难熬的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:53.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but it's definitely made me a stronger person,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但它让我变得更强大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:54.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a better person,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N变成更好的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.95,0:02:57.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and hopefully it'll make me a better tennis player.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N希望也让我成为更好的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.69,0:03:01.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I've been kind of good to go really from kind of US Open time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N其实美网时我就能复出了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Decided not to play that,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我决定不打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.41,0:03:08.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to almost just put my body under a bit more stress.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让身体再多扛一些强度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:10.15,TL,,0,0,0,,她本可以早点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.15,0:03:12.36,TL,,0,0,0,,可她说 受伤后最好的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:13.87,TL,,0,0,0,,是别着急
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:19.33,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月 她在比利 简 金杯总决赛复出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:20.25,TL,,0,0,0,,到了武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:23.42,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿受伤前{\fs78}50{\fs68}多位的保护排名报名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.29,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢卡利尼娜和本西奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:28.39,TL,,0,0,0,,又只用{\fs78}63{\fs68}分钟 送走了保利尼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:34.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And takes it with a thunderous forehand,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一记重炮正手拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.09,0:03:38.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and Sonay Kartal continues her comeback{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡塔尔继续她的复出之路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:42.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from that stress fracture that saw her miss six months of this season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个赛季她因应力性骨折缺席半年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:47.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Third round in Beijing is now matched with a third round appearance in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N继北京之后 武汉又进第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.61,0:03:53.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's the first Briton ever to make the last four in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首位打进武汉半决赛的英国人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:55.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a story.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多好的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Out for six months this season,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个赛季停了六个月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.29,0:04:05.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but now getting to the latter stages of the biggest of events.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在却打到了大赛的最后阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:08.80,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 对手两次发球胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:10.37,TL,,0,0,0,,两次都被她破回
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:12.89,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘都是先落后 再追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:14.72,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘抢七 {\fs78}11{\fs68}比{\fs78}9{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.57,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 又是抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:19.14,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}个盘点 她一个没给
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.47,0:04:25.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I was dreaming of playing this match when I was fully fit before the injury,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N受伤之前 我就梦想打这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:29.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so to be able to come back here in my third event{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N复出第三站就能来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:33.37,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and to achieve this regardless is a huge milestone for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N做到这一步 对我是一座里程碑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:35.09,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛设立{\fs78}17{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:37.47,TL,,0,0,0,,她是排名最低的决赛选手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:38.89,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}号的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:41.20,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是另一场半决赛的胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:42.20,TL,,0,0,0,,打完这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:44.20,TL,,0,0,0,,她会回到世界前{\fs78}50{\fs68}左右
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:46.11,TL,,0,0,0,,成为新的英国一姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.11,0:04:48.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}个月前 她疼得连刷牙都难
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.71,TL,,0,0,0,,伤好了 她没有急
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:53.11,TL,,0,0,0,,如果是你 你等得住吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:55.56,TL,,0,0,0,,这场决赛 你押她吗？
